		"en": [
			"• The Thousand Sunny, which decorates One Piece's 20th anniversary, is now available in the One Piece Great Ship Collection in a memorial color version based on the original color image!",
			"• Reproduces the coloring with soap coating.",
			"• To commemorate the memorial, a specially drawn plate inspired by the cover of the original comic is included!",
			"• The included wave parts have also been updated! Divided type allows for various displays!"
